@startuml
title US12 - Register an Employee\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

Admin -> System : Requests employee registration

System --> Admin : Returns available roles

Admin -> System : Selects a Role

System --> Admin : Requests mandatory employee information (name, phone number and e-mail)

Admin -> System : Submits employee information

opt Selected role is Specialist Doctor
    System --> Admin : Requests "Doctor Index Number"
    Admin -> System : Submits "Doctor Index Number"
end

System --> Admin : Confirms employee registration and displays the assigned ID


@enduml